      "explanation": "Plot of Z (number of protons) verses N (number\nof neutrons) is represented as :\n<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2016 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Chemical Kinetics and Nuclear Chemistry Question 48 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1li7c1y9r/71e5862c-9c5d-497b-bec1-3874ea0a56a1/23283c00-fd4a-11ed-9cd2-058c7b5f35bd/file-1li7c1y9s.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n<br>(a) For a stable nucleus <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.469ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24.602ex\" height=\"4.07ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1149.5 10874.2 1799\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(2027.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(597,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(220,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> no. of neutrons </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(432.1,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> no. of protons </text></g><rect width=\"7412.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8249.5,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> should be equal to 1.\n<br><br>This happens for elements till atomic number <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.675ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3834.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1389.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2445.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3445.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. For such nucleus number of proton are equal to number of neutrons.\n<br><br>(b) For heavier nucleides with atomic number <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.143ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1389 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> greater than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.938ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4834.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1389,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D44D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2389.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3445.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4445.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the number of neutron are more than proton as seen by curved (green) appearance in the plot.\n<br><br>(c) For nucleids with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.359ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3694.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5A\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2138.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3194.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the number of neutrons are less than the protons making the nucleus unstable. This is due to increase in coulombic repulsions between positively charged protons.\n<br><br>Such nuclei become stable by K-electron capture and positron emission.\n<br><br><b>K-electron capture :</b>\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.804ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.043ex\" height=\"2.705ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -840.1 6206.8 1195.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-287.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(436.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1161.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(2162,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,369.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(33,-297.3) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3148.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D452\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D452\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3892.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\" transform=\"translate(5170.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-287.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5606.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>The K-electron capture, proton is converted to the neutron as increases the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.21ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1861 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"><use data-c=\"2F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5A\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ratio.\n<br><br><b><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\